# GoRag — Multimodal RAG System (PDF + Tables + Figures)

GoRag is a production-ready multimodal Retrieval-Augmented Generation system that allows users to:

✅ Upload PDFs  
✅ Extract text, tables, and figures  
✅ Store everything in Qdrant Vector DB  
✅ Ask questions with supporting visuals shown inline  

---

## Features

- PDF Text Chunking  
- Table Extraction using Camelot  
- Figure Extraction using PyMuPDF  
- Vector Search powered by Qdrant  
- FastAPI Backend  
- React + Tailwind Frontend Evidence Panel  

---

## Tech Stack

Backend:
- FastAPI
- Qdrant Cloud
- SentenceTransformers
- Camelot
- PyMuPDF

Frontend:
- React (Vite)
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion

---

## Setup Instructions

### Backend

cd Backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app:app --port 8000

### Frontend 
navigate to frontend folder - cd frontend 
run npm run dev 
